CHAPTER.VERS:
Hereby you

          {+}
         know the Spirit of God: every spirit that confesses that Jesus Christ has come in the flesh is of God:

and every spirit that does not confess Jesus is not of God: and this is the [spirit] of the antichrist, of which you

          {+}
         have heard that it comes; and now it is in the world already.

You

          {+}
         are of God, [my] little children, and have overcome them: because greater is he who is in you

          {+}
         than he who is in the world.
